## Not included in the repository

| Item | Why |
|---|---|
| `phase1/images/` (Sculpt OS image, signature, Genode key) | Third-party binary; link to genode.org instead |
| `gemma-results/`, `phase0/runs/*/kartr_log.jsonl` | Run artefacts; publish summaries only |
| Any keyring, ledger store or private key | Personal |
| `WORKLOG.md` | Internal; replace with a public CHANGELOG |

## Third-party software Turiya uses (not bundled)

| Component | Use | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| Genode OS framework / Sculpt OS | Phase 1 base system | AGPL-3.0 (with Genode Labs' commercial option) |
| seL4 microkernel | Phase 2 kernel | GPL-2.0 (kernel); BSD-2-Clause (user libraries) |
| Python `cryptography` | Ed25519, ECDSA P-256 | Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause |
| `qrcode` | Key-card QR images | BSD-3-Clause |
| OpenCV (`opencv-python-headless`) | QR decoding in tests | Apache-2.0 |
| Gemma 4 (local model) | Agent and judge in tests | Gemma terms of use (model weights not bundled) |

All are compatible with distributing Turiya under AGPL-3.0-or-later as long as none is bundled with a conflicting licence. Check each licence again at publish time.
